<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-6494] .NET: CacheConfiguration.WriteSynchronizationMode incorrect default value</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-6494</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;tt&gt;CacheConfiguration.WriteSynchronizationMode&lt;/tt&gt; has no explicit default in .NET, which causes it to be &lt;tt&gt;FullSync&lt;/tt&gt; (first enum value). Java-side default is &lt;tt&gt;PRIMARY_SYNC&lt;/tt&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Write a test to make sure all defaults are the same (start a cache from Spring and get configuration).&lt;/p&gt;</description>
